  "conclusion": "Each popup owns only PagedTutorial; each page owns RectTransform, CanvasRenderer, CanvasGroup. PagedTutorial Awake calls UpdatePageVisibility, whose recorded body activates the page GameObject and sets its CanvasGroup alpha; it does not traverse or activate title descendants. Navigation animators are outside the page subtree and cannot animate title descendants through child paths. No owning root/page Animator or serialized event targets a title root. The normal recorded page-show body preserves child m_IsActive.",
  "limits": "Existing method trace reused, no recursive IL or runtime invocation. Arbitrary external reflection or code outside this owning route is not excluded. Runtime visual acceptance remains false."
